      "text": "Establishing strategic and favorable relations with neighboring countries is of vital importance for Afghanistan; given the lack of regular transportation and an equipped railway network, the more Afghanistan uses the routes of neighboring countries for exports and imports, the more the costs of transporting goods will decrease",
